sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Operator / Client
    participant UI as Toolkit Frontend (Aadhaar / PAN Modal)
    participant API as FastAPI Toolkit Router (/api/v1/toolkit)
    participant DocService as Document Processing Service
    participant Engine as PyMuPDF (fitz) & Pillow

    User->>UI: Upload File (PDF/Image) + Optional Password + Client Name
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/toolkit/documents/crop-aadhaar (multipart/form-data)
    
    API->>DocService: process_aadhaar_document(file_bytes, password, client_name)
    
    alt Password Protected PDF
        DocService->>DocService: Attempt supplied password
        DocService->>Engine: Decrypt PDF with fitz
        Note over DocService,Engine: Auto-fallback password permutations<br/>(Name prefix + YYYY)
    end

    DocService->>Engine: Open first page with PyMuPDF
    DocService->>DocService: Calculate fixed crop bounding box<br/>Top: 72%, Left: 8%, Bottom: 7%, Right: 8%
    DocService->>Engine: Render cropped pixmap at 300 DPI
    
    DocService->>DocService: Auto-format DOB (DD/MM/YYYY) via regex
    DocService->>DocService: Generate standardized filename<br/>({ClientName}_Aadhaar_Cropped_{Date}.pdf)
    
    DocService->>Engine: Export to PDF/A & high-res PNG preview
    DocService-->>API: Processed bytes, metadata, preview base64
    
    API-->>UI: HTTP 200 OK {download_url, filename, preview_url, status: "SUCCESS"}
    UI-->>User: Display side-by-side cropped preview & download button
